<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-15T20:27:08.435Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:27:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard, aided by the Philippine Navy and the US Navy, drove away a Chinese fishing vessel and its four small boats conducting illegal fishing near Lawak Island in Kalayaan. The Philippine Navy also patrolled near Scarborough Shoal, encountering three Chinese vessels, including two PLAN warships. China issued warnings to the Philippines to stop provocations and separately warned Taiwan about consequences for using water cannons against a Chinese ship. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQOUtLT3R4b1VYNHMtR0l0QzFONUdOOTJtVl9hdWNVejA3bzhkN0JBVWc4TW5IR2pGbDJ0ZGFmeGN2YXNTbGVhMFZPQ2owQUdJZm5JR19GRkVHTTlGVHFHNkZ2ZWxfbEdMUEg4Qy1ZcnRyU2R6d01UUTR5NnNRMGh6STM5QndZVW9TdmZDMW9oTmpxRHo3YXB5WXNZQzIyaFBhTzgxNlBR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPN1hDdnpPSkZYMjdIRkllbzhqU0dDYkdsdnJIWFZQUU1fZ1VITFc5SDJhbFNia0VHdExobkQwZDduUTRpeGpOT0lBUkV3NVdXM3EzSEFBVEVzTFh0UGlhWHZzdGJ0RFFhMjRwNkJ4NFk0RmU1cmFpZmpoMnpaQ0VlUVYwd2tycWhRSy01QXNyVkY1ZDROVmJIb0o1RXphSE1keU01SWFOTG5haWlvTU5VajlZWHg3c3ZkV2N3MEJ1RmN5UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rappler&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxObWNpZlNiQm1PNmhVa05sMFlERk1KdWtaMmxSVnZUWEJrVlZUTTBaU1FCMU9yR1hkNmtmdXhLbl9tQ0VsdW8yUTVWR2NOS2N2cEdoNk1URkp0dC1LbzJCQnF0TVg3YS1ZUkttaFgwUk9qQ0gyTG5QaHMwRDJwS1ladVhZdWpfREpkb2